      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRAX KEEPING (1) finished third last time (30.83) at Murray Bridge after winning at his previous two outings. Makes plenty of appeal. TODD KEEPING (3) has a terrific record here with eight wins and one placing from nine starts. Was out of placings last time (26.05) at Murray Bridge in a Grade 4/5, finishing fifth and beaten 9 lengths. Suited here and expected to run well. SHREWD (5) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 6 length win at this track in a handy 30.44. Has a tricky draw to overcome but has the ability and in winning form. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. In sparkling form and looks the one to beat again. JUST A NUISANCE (7) jumped best and was never headed last time. Big chance again.",
